# The movie of Figure 7 of Wyper et al. (2018), which the journal holds the
# copyright to and only serves through links which expire after a week. The
# slide falls back to the still of the same figure, linked from the journal,
# wherever the movie has not been downloaded.
docs/media/wyper-2018-figure-7.mp4
